  "solution": {
    "text": "i)<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0110_f8a64f75f036.png\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 116px;\" /><br />ii) Battery disconnected after full charge,<br />Total charge of the system,<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0110_1af4a9fba3e0.png\" style=\"width: 186px; height: 100px;\" /><br />iii) Inserting dielectric of constant <math><mi>K</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0110_353f8fa3504f.png\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 100px;\" /><br />Common potential, <math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\">